WEBVTT

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.123
Time slows down.

00:05:31.123 --> 00:05:33.347
You get this weird tunnel vision.

00:05:33.347 --> 00:05:37.008
You notice some details very, very, very accurately

00:05:37.008 --> 00:05:39.195
and other things drop out.

00:05:39.195 --> 00:05:42.158
It's almost a slightly altered state of mind.

00:05:42.158 --> 00:05:43.629
What's happening in your brain

00:05:43.629 --> 00:05:46.346
is you're getting an enormous amount of adrenaline

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:48.166
pumped through your system.

00:05:48.166 --> 00:05:50.760
Young men will go to great lengths

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.096
to have that experience.

00:05:53.096 --> 00:05:56.018
It's wired into us.

00:05:56.018 --> 00:05:59.860
It's hormonally supported.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.745
The mortality rate for young men in society